OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle under
OL,4,Ahouse arrest after child sex abuse
OL,5,Amaterial charge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been placed
OL,9,Funder house detention at his assisted
OL,10,Fliving facility in Florida after being
OL,11,Fcharged over possession of child sex
OL,12,Fabuse material.
OL,14,FMarkle, 82, was arrested in Florida on
OL,15,Fa federal complaint alleging he held
OL,16,Fimages that show child sex abuse, the
OL,17,FUS Department of Justice (DoJ) said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
