OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle under
OL,4,Ahouse arrest after child sex abuse
OL,5,Amaterial charge
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is charged with one count of
OL,8,Fpossessing indecent images of children,
OL,9,Fthe DoJ said. Markle has previously
OL,10,Fdenied allegations of possessing images
OL,11,Fof child sex abuse, calling them "sick
OL,12,Flies".
OL,14,FIn a 30-minute court hearing on Friday
OL,15,Fhe was also ordered to submit to
OL,16,Felectronic monitoring, but no plea was
OL,17,Ftaken.
